#: includes/email/ppcart-template-functions/templates.php:230
msgid ""
"Order ID: {order_id}\n"
"Order Date: {order_date}\n"
"\n"
"You're receiving this email because we have processed your refund of {last_refund_amount}. It can take up to 10 days to appear on your statement, if it takes longer please contact your bank for assistance."
msgstr ""
"Order ID: {order_id}\n"
"Petsa ng Order: {order_date}\n"
"\n"
"Nakatanggap ka ng email na ito dahil pinroseso namin ang iyong refund na {last_refund_amount}. Maaaring abutin ng hanggang 10 araw upang lumitaw ito sa iyong pahayag, kung lumampas pa dito mangyaring makipag-ugnayan sa iyong bangko para sa tulong."

#: includes/email/ppcart-template-functions/templates.php:242
msgid "Your {product_name} trial is about to end"
msgstr "Malapit nang magtapos ang iyong pagsubok na {product_name}"

#: includes/email/ppcart-template-functions/templates.php:246
msgid ""
"Hi {customer_firstname},\n"
"\n"
"Your trial is ending on <strong>{next_bill_date}</strong>. Once your trial is complete, we will automatically charge the payment method we have on file for <strong>{order_amount}</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"To cancel your trial, please log in to <a href=\"{login}\">your account</a>.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you,\n"
"{site_name}"
msgstr ""
"Hi {customer_firstname},\n"
"\n"
"Ang iyong pagsubok ay magtatapos sa <strong>{next_bill_date}</strong>. Kapag natapos na ang iyong pagsubok, awtomatiko kaming sisingilin sa paraan ng pagbabayad na mayroon kami para sa <strong>{order_amount}</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"Upang kanselahin ang iyong pagsubok, mangyaring mag-log in sa <a href=\"{login}\">iyong account</a>.\n"
"\n"
"Salamat,\n"
"{site_name}"

